    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Bonded Vessel"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "The condition of a stone spider's vessel dictates its maximum HP. Undamaged, the vessel is an object with 62 HP (BT 31). When the stone spider is in spirit form, damaging it doesn't hurt the vessel, but damaging the vessel deals an equal amount of damage to the stone spider. When the stone spider Inhabits its Vessel, they're a single target, and damage reduces the HP of both the stone spider and the vessel. If the vessel is broken, the stone spider can still fight while inhabiting it and suffers no ill effect, but if the vessel is ever destroyed, the stone spider is instantly slain and can't reconstitute."
            },
            "id": "8e50be24-df35-4cd0-be52-00e508d14010",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:11.197815"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Reconstitution"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nWhen the stone spider reaches 0 Hit Points, its spirit dissipates. If its bonded vessel is intact, the stone spider re-forms in this vessel after 2d4 days, fully healed. If the vessel is broken, it must first be Repaired, after which the stone spider re-forms in 3d4 days."
            },
            "id": "7d09703e-5ae6-4680-a2c3-b2c12fa14ee9",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:11.197815"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Anchored Soul"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "The stone spider is bonded to a specific settlement and must remain within 10 miles of the settlement's border."
            },
            "id": "b24c0fa5-4d2c-4ff7-97ae-91b239a1298d",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:11.197815"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Spirit Body"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "When not Inhabiting its Vessel, the stone spider is incorporeal and gains resistance 6 to all damage (except force damage and ghost touch; double resistance against non-magical)."
            },
            "id": "837463b3-81c6-448c-8ce6-9a921f367eb6",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-19T22:59:11.197815"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Spirit Web Trap"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(force)\n\nA creature hit by the stone spider's web attack is immobilized and stuck to the nearest surface until it Escapes (DC 22)."
            },
            "id": "1e4652ea-8b2f-445f-9003-9f0eaf34506a",
