            "action_name": {
              "value": "Inhabit Vessel"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(manipulate)\n\nThe spider touches and melds with its bonded vessel, bringing it to life. It can cease Inhabiting its Vessel by spending a single action, which has the concentrate trait. While Inhabiting the Vessel, it loses its fly Speed and gains **Immunities** healing, nonlethal; **Resistances** physical 6 (except bludgeoning); Speed 25 feet, climb 25 feet; and the following Strike.\n\n- **Melee** 1A stone fangs 14 (finesse), Damage 2d8+7 piercing"
